(7501252, 1195311, 150202, '<td valign="top">For some reason the background makes the bus look in motion instead of the girl (even though the building is blurred too). Probably just me, maybe because you expect buses to move. The girl is amazingly sharp, nice job.</td>', 'For some reason the background makes the bus look in motion instead of the girl (even though the building is blurred too). Probably just me, maybe because you expect buses to move. The girl is amazingly sharp, nice job.', '2017-02-21 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501255, 1195368, 150202, '<td valign="top">The motion looks blurred without purpose. It doesn''t indicate motion or make it abstract, so it just seems busy to me and I want to see what the men are wearing.  I like the lighting and exposure.</td>', 'The motion looks blurred without purpose. It doesn''t indicate motion or make it abstract, so it just seems busy to me and I want to see what the men are wearing.  I like the lighting and exposure.', '2017-02-21 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
