(7501564, 1195311, 185772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tumbleweed:</b></div><hr/><i> For some reason the background makes the bus look in motion instead of the girl (even though the building is blurred too). Probably just me, maybe because you expect buses to move. The girl is amazingly sharp, nice job. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes the buses were moving too. Thank you for your comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tumbleweed: For some reason the background makes the bus look in motion instead of the girl (even though the building is blurred too). Probably just me, maybe because you expect buses to move. The girl is amazingly sharp, nice job.   Yes the buses were moving too. Thank you for your comment.', '2017-02-22 04:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
